WEBVTT

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.130 --> 00:21.940
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.130 --> 00:22.180
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.940 --> 00:26.970
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.970 --> 00:33.150
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.150 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.860
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.860 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.680
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.680 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.330
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.330 --> 01:23.760
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.760 --> 01:30.140
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.140 --> 01:35.540
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.540 --> 01:44.650
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

02:17.090 --> 02:18.360
<b>Wait a sec, Bun-chan.</b>

02:18.360 --> 02:20.360
<b>Let me just attach this part.</b>

02:25.260 --> 02:26.530
<b>What...?</b>

02:28.630 --> 02:30.400
<b>You helped me?</b>

02:38.540 --> 02:41.110
<b>You remembered...</b>

02:48.250 --> 02:52.060
<b>As of today, I’m seventeen.</b>

02:54.750 --> 03:01.720
<b>A Seventeen Year Old Girl’</b>s
Encounter & Despair

03:01.170 --> 03:02.630
<b>Hello?</b>

03:02.630 --> 03:06.100
<b>What’s wrong?
You don’t sound too good.</b>

03:06.100 --> 03:07.170
<b>Umm...</b>

03:07.170 --> 03:08.300
<b>What is it?</b>

03:09.440 --> 03:13.810
<b>Old Lady Okaka... came to my
house here in Yokohama.</b>

03:13.810 --> 03:16.340
<b>You mean <i>the</i> Old Lady Okaka?</b>

03:17.110 --> 03:20.780
<b>There’s only one Old Lady Okaka.</b>

03:20.780 --> 03:22.150
<b>I guess so.</b>

03:22.150 --> 03:23.880
<b>But...</b>

03:29.420 --> 03:33.590
<b>She brought Dosshiru and Shisshin
with her to my place.</b>

03:33.600 --> 03:37.830
<b>Is she at your place now?</b>

03:38.600 --> 03:39.670
<b>Nope.</b>

03:39.670 --> 03:42.800
<b>She appeared in the evening,
but she was gone by morning.</b>

03:44.170 --> 03:45.140
<b>Umm...</b>

03:46.040 --> 03:48.280
<b>It was the morning after the first snowfall here.</b>

03:48.280 --> 03:51.010
<b>I looked all over,
but I couldn’t find her.</b>

03:52.350 --> 03:55.220
<b>Could she be...</b>

03:55.220 --> 03:57.520
<b>...trying to come back to Tana now?</b>

04:07.600 --> 04:10.870
<b>Could you pass this along
to Sakakura for me?</b>

04:10.870 --> 04:12.570
<b>Sakakura?</b>

04:15.300 --> 04:19.440
<b>Well, Old Lady Okaka is
like his soul mate.</b>

04:19.440 --> 04:22.140
<b>I see. Okay.</b>

04:25.780 --> 04:28.480
<b>[Kannai Station]</b>

04:36.260 --> 04:38.430
<b>Hey, that has to be it over there.</b>

04:42.930 --> 04:44.370
<b>Don’t you think this is it?</b>

04:44.370 --> 04:48.040
<b>So these are, like, those dark lights
that’ll bring you fortune?</b>

04:48.040 --> 04:50.440
<b>But isn’t this, like, kind of mecha-y?</b>

04:50.440 --> 04:53.170
<b>This has to be it.</b>

04:53.180 --> 04:54.410
<b>Come on, take a picture.</b>

04:56.280 --> 05:01.250
<b>Graffiti like this means, like, someone
saw the lights’ true forms, right?</b>

05:01.880 --> 05:03.380
<b>No way! I so wanna see them, too!</b>

05:03.390 --> 05:05.450
<b>How would you do it?</b>

05:08.490 --> 05:11.260
<b>This really makes you wanna see them, huh?</b>

05:09.890 --> 05:11.260
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:11.260 --> 05:12.530
<b>Hey, did you know?</b>

05:12.530 --> 05:15.760
<b>Apparently, there’s this girl who took a picture of one of the lights with her cell.</b>

05:15.760 --> 05:17.500
<b>What? Really?</b>

05:17.500 --> 05:18.730
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:18.730 --> 05:19.800
<b>Shall we get going?</b>

05:19.800 --> 05:20.940
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:20.940 --> 05:22.370
<b>What do you wanna do now?</b>

05:22.370 --> 05:24.210
<b>I’m hungry...</b>

05:28.880 --> 05:31.510
<b>Do you also... trust yourself?</b>

05:33.400 --> 05:35.140
<b>I trust myself.</b>

05:35.140 --> 05:36.980
<b>After all, I did see them.</b>

05:38.600 --> 05:40.750
<b>I got involved with them.</b>

05:43.490 --> 05:46.060
<b>Do you think I’m just some weirdo
saying strange things?</b>

05:51.030 --> 05:53.570
<b>The summer before last, I...</b>

05:56.140 --> 05:57.540
<b>I must really sound strange, huh?</b>

05:58.370 --> 06:01.080
<b>Suddenly talking to you like this.</b>

06:01.080 --> 06:01.810
<b>Yeah...</b>

06:01.810 --> 06:03.010
<b>You sure are honest.</b>

06:06.450 --> 06:09.320
<b>Well, just pretend that I’m talking
to myself and ignore me.</b>

06:12.190 --> 06:15.690
<b>I think I stepped over
the boundary two years ago...</b>

06:16.660 --> 06:18.560
<b>Boundary?</b>

06:18.560 --> 06:20.660
<b>The line between this world
and the other.</b>

06:21.330 --> 06:25.130
<b>Because I became involved with things that
couldn’t possibly exist in this world.</b>

06:25.800 --> 06:28.000
<b>Do you understand what I’m saying?</b>

06:29.840 --> 06:31.110
<b>Sort of...</b>

06:34.710 --> 06:37.080
<b>Is it possible that you’re
the same as me?</b>

06:38.050 --> 06:40.150
<b>Earlier...</b>

06:40.150 --> 06:44.020
<b>...I saw you peeking into your bag,
and I thought that might be the case.</b>

06:46.990 --> 06:49.960
<b>I thought I was finished with everything.</b>

06:49.960 --> 06:51.990
<b>But I was wrong.</b>

06:51.990 --> 06:54.260
<b>There’s still something left for me to do.</b>

06:55.630 --> 06:57.600
<b>Hey, take out your cell phone.</b>

07:00.670 --> 07:02.200
<b>Aizawa Ayumu.</b>

07:02.200 --> 07:05.040
<b>That’s my name.
I’ll give you my cell number.</b>

