08:17.610 --> 08:20.580
<b>Tokimiya</b>

08:27.820 --> 08:30.160
<b>Hey, Hana-san...</b>

08:30.160 --> 08:32.490
<b>If, and this is a big if...</b>

08:34.130 --> 08:39.330
<b>If I took up shogi, do you think I’d be
able to understand Shigeki better?</b>

08:44.710 --> 08:46.670
<b>I don’t know about that.</b>

08:46.680 --> 08:47.310
<b>No?</b>

08:47.310 --> 08:53.780
<b>Learning shogi and understanding Shigeki
are two entirely different things.</b>

08:57.390 --> 09:00.050
<b>That aside, isn’t it today?</b>

09:00.060 --> 09:01.490
<b>Kisa’s birthday, that is.</b>

09:01.490 --> 09:02.820
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:03.960 --> 09:07.090
<b>I wonder if Shigeki likes Kisa...</b>

09:09.060 --> 09:10.730
<b>Why are you laughing?</b>

09:12.070 --> 09:13.430
<b>I doubt it.</b>

09:13.440 --> 09:19.240
<b>But... he’s kinder and sweeter
towards Kisa...</b>

09:19.240 --> 09:22.880
<b>Shigeki sees himself in Kisa.</b>

09:24.650 --> 09:27.150
<b>Because in front of the shogi board, he’s all alone.</b>

09:27.780 --> 09:31.590
<b>Even though he looks the way
he does, Shigeki’s also lonely.</b>

09:31.590 --> 09:33.120
<b>But Kisa...</b>

09:33.660 --> 09:38.430
<b>“Kisa built a shell of loneliness around herself”?</b>

09:38.430 --> 09:39.590
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:42.500 --> 09:44.100
<b>Even if that’s true...</b>

09:44.100 --> 09:47.800
<b>...Kisa must have a reason why.</b>

09:48.740 --> 09:52.810
<b>Because she made it herself,
only she can escape from it.</b>

09:54.680 --> 09:59.280
<b>I guess you’d say they’re two lonely peas in a pod.</b>

09:59.280 --> 10:01.750
<b>I wonder about that...</b>

10:08.780 --> 10:17.700
<b></b>Dad's also away

10:08.780 --> 10:17.700
<b></b>so be careful not to go

10:08.780 --> 10:17.700
<b></b>walking around alone.

10:08.780 --> 10:17.700
<b></b>- Mom

10:08.790 --> 10:17.700
<b></b>I'll be away on a b

10:08.790 --> 10:17.700
<b></b>trip today andtom{&\alpha&H00&}orrow.

10:48.700 --> 10:50.530
<b><i>“To the me of a year from today...”</i></b>

10:51.700 --> 10:55.500
<b><i>“I thought that something would
change once I turned seventeen.”</i></b>

10:56.070 --> 10:58.140
<b><i>“But nothing’s changed at all.”</i></b>

10:57.500 --> 10:59.470
<b>Sending mail</b>

11:00.110 --> 11:02.740
<b><i>“Everything is the same today as it was yesterday.”</i></b>

11:04.450 --> 11:08.420
<b><i>“I wonder if I’ve changed now that I’m seventeen?”</i></b>

11:06.440 --> 11:08.410
<b>You have new mail</b>

11:14.750 --> 11:16.090
<b>Incoming</b>

11:14.750 --> 11:16.090
<b>Shigeki</b>

11:18.130 --> 11:19.160
<b>Hello?</b>

11:19.160 --> 11:22.100
<b>Sorry, I didn’t notice your call earlier.</b>

11:22.100 --> 11:24.030
<b>It’s all right.</b>

11:24.030 --> 11:26.900
<b>I know you have a lot to deal with.</b>

11:26.900 --> 11:28.600
<b>Did something happen today?</b>

11:30.010 --> 11:31.640
<b>Hello? Can you hear me?</b>

11:32.510 --> 11:34.310
<b>Yeah...</b>

11:34.310 --> 11:36.110
<b>What’s wrong?</b>

11:37.610 --> 11:40.280
<b>I... met this strange person today...</b>

11:40.280 --> 11:42.920
<b>...and wasn’t sure what to do about it.</b>

11:42.920 --> 11:44.550
<b>A strange person?</b>

11:44.550 --> 11:46.520
<b>I’m sorry...
I’m gonna have to cut you off...</b>

11:46.520 --> 11:48.760
<b>Kisa, are you all right?</b>

11:48.760 --> 11:51.490
<b>Yeah... I’ll call you back soon.</b>

11:57.930 --> 12:00.230
<b>Even though I had already known...</b>

12:00.240 --> 12:04.410
<b>No one would remember my birthday...</b>

12:04.410 --> 12:05.940
<b>Even though I had already known...</b>

12:28.930 --> 12:32.730
<b>[Ramen Menu]</b>

12:30.700 --> 12:32.730
<b>Welcome.</b>

12:35.400 --> 12:36.700
<b>Two ramen, please.</b>

12:36.710 --> 12:37.200
<b>Coming up.</b>

12:40.180 --> 12:43.280
<b>This is second-hand news from my old boss, but...</b>

12:43.280 --> 12:47.180
<b>...cold-colored lights apparently appeared
during the Cat Dance.</b>

12:47.180 --> 12:49.150
<b>Like the ones in the chain mail?</b>

12:49.150 --> 12:50.650
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:50.650 --> 12:52.890
<b>They were flying with the others?</b>

12:52.890 --> 12:56.560
<b>The cold-colored ones weren’t seen flying around.</b>

12:56.560 --> 12:59.690
<b>They simply glowed on the ground.</b>

12:59.690 --> 13:02.860
<b>You mean they came out of the ground?</b>

13:02.860 --> 13:04.270
<b>It was industrial waste.</b>

13:04.270 --> 13:06.570
<b>They came out of a mountain of industrial garbage.</b>

13:08.540 --> 13:10.700
<b>I’m starting to get impatient...</b>

13:10.710 --> 13:13.440
<b>I’d really like to finally get some evidence.</b>

13:13.440 --> 13:17.550
<b>Like some big sign saying
“material fairies <i>do</i> exist, everyone!”</b>

13:18.580 --> 13:21.250
<b>Here’s your ramen.</b>

13:24.090 --> 13:26.320
<b>Welcome.</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:28.860
<b>That time...</b>

13:26.960 --> 13:28.860
<b>Here’s your ramen and gyoza.</b>

13:28.860 --> 13:32.630
<b>When we first met, how much
of the story did you hear?</b>

13:32.630 --> 13:34.050
<b>Like I said before,</b>

13:34.050 --> 13:37.730
<b>from about the part where you mentioned
“the thing you can see but can’t see...”</b>

13:39.130 --> 13:41.570
<b>Are you hiding something?</b>

13:40.570 --> 13:43.040
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

13:41.570 --> 13:43.040
<b>No, nothing...</b>

13:45.840 --> 13:47.710
<b>He said that?</b>

13:47.710 --> 13:49.980
<b>That he saw them and became involved with them?</b>

13:49.980 --> 13:50.910
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:50.910 --> 13:53.250
<b>And that things aren’t finished
for him yet?</b>

13:53.250 --> 13:54.580
<b>Yeah...</b>

14:01.920 --> 14:03.620
<b>Hello?</b>

14:07.630 --> 14:09.300
<b>Should we try meeting with him?</b>

14:09.300 --> 14:11.300
<b>Meeting with him?</b>

14:12.270 --> 14:14.000
<b>He’s bugging us both now...</b>

14:14.000 --> 14:16.240
<b>...so meeting and talking with
him would be fastest, right?</b>

14:16.240 --> 14:18.510
<b>Yeah...</b>

14:18.510 --> 14:20.140
<b>I’ll go with you.</b>

14:22.440 --> 14:23.880
<b>But...</b>

14:23.880 --> 14:27.680
<b>Hana-san told me that you have
to properly face your opponents.</b>

14:27.680 --> 14:30.280
<b>You need to properly approach this guy.</b>

14:30.290 --> 14:31.690
<b>That’s how I feel.</b>

14:31.690 --> 14:32.990
<b>Yeah...</b>

14:32.990 --> 14:35.660
<b>If it’s not your thing,
I won’t force you.</b>

14:38.330 --> 14:41.100
<b>It may not be that bad of an idea
to see him...</b>

14:41.560 --> 14:45.970
<b>If you do, you won’t have to feel so misty
about this whole thing anymore, right?</b>

14:47.440 --> 14:48.570
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:52.470 --> 14:55.010
<b>Wanna come in?
I can at least offer you some tea.</b>

14:55.010 --> 14:56.410
<b>Umm...</b>

15:06.760 --> 15:08.490
<b>Forget it...</b>

15:08.490 --> 15:10.960
<b>Get a grip on yourself, boy.</b>

15:22.640 --> 15:24.510
<b>Heading inside?</b>

15:24.510 --> 15:25.310
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:26.580 --> 15:28.010
<b>Wanna join me?</b>

15:28.010 --> 15:28.780
<b>That’s all right.</b>

15:31.410 --> 15:32.950
<b>Ah, phone call.</b>

15:34.450 --> 15:36.150
<b>I’m fine.</b>

15:36.150 --> 15:38.150
<b>Did you manage to get
in touch with him?</b>

15:41.420 --> 15:43.490
<b>Kisa, where are you right now?</b>

15:44.960 --> 15:46.230
<b>Okay.</b>

15:46.230 --> 15:50.030
<b>Then... do you know where the tree in Queen Mall is?</b>

15:50.030 --> 15:52.400
<b>It’s been there since last month.</b>

15:53.700 --> 15:56.470
<b>Ah, is that so?
Well, it’s near the overpass.</b>

15:56.470 --> 15:58.140
<b>Let’s meet there.</b>

16:00.410 --> 16:02.940
<b>Not going to Tokimiya anymore,
it seems. See you later.</b>

16:15.160 --> 16:15.890
<b>Did you wait long?</b>

16:18.730 --> 16:21.630
<b>Don’t look that way. It’s fine.</b>

16:21.630 --> 16:22.100
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:24.800 --> 16:25.570
<b>Shall we go?</b>

16:25.570 --> 16:26.530
<b>Ah, wait.</b>

16:34.010 --> 16:35.880
<b>Happy birthday.</b>

16:38.650 --> 16:39.850
<b>Will you accept it?</b>

16:44.350 --> 16:45.850
<b>Don’t you like it?</b>

16:46.760 --> 16:48.290
<b>Thank you...</b>

16:53.260 --> 16:55.530
<b>I’ll take good care of it...</b>

16:58.770 --> 17:01.070
<b>What did you mean on the phone?</b>

17:01.070 --> 17:04.870
<b>Because I promised,
I kept it secret all this time, but...</b>

17:05.340 --> 17:09.280
<b>...there’s a girl I know who keeps a material fairy.</b>

17:09.280 --> 17:10.340
<b>She <i>keeps</i> one?</b>

17:10.810 --> 17:12.350
<b>I’ll let you meet her.</b>

17:17.190 --> 17:20.520
<b>This is my first time coming here.</b>

17:20.520 --> 17:22.790
<b>Mine, too.</b>

17:23.330 --> 17:25.030
<b>Why here?</b>

17:25.030 --> 17:29.560
<b>I thought I might have to show him Bun-chan, so...</b>

17:29.560 --> 17:33.000
<b>So you picked a place where
no one was likely to be, huh?</b>

17:33.000 --> 17:36.000
<b>So, where is he?</b>

17:44.680 --> 17:45.980
<b>There he is.</b>

17:49.150 --> 17:51.520
<b>They said they’d meet here.</b>

17:51.520 --> 17:54.520
<b>Is there a place around here that’s likely to be empty?</b>

17:55.790 --> 17:57.260
<b>Rinkou Park!</b>

17:57.260 --> 17:58.560
<b>Which way is it?</b>

18:18.010 --> 18:19.150
<b>Thank you.</b>

18:19.150 --> 18:22.050
<b>I didn’t think I’d be able to see you again so soon.</b>

18:23.150 --> 18:27.020
<b>You said something about getting involved
with something you can but can’t see?</b>

18:27.760 --> 18:28.890
<b>Yes.</b>

18:28.890 --> 18:33.990
<b>As a matter of convenience,
I’ll call them “material fairies,” okay?</b>

18:34.760 --> 18:37.730
<b>Material... fairies?</b>

18:37.730 --> 18:40.400
<b>Someone named Sukawara-san
gave them that name, but...</b>

18:40.400 --> 18:41.970
<b>I don’t think it’s a bad name, so...</b>

18:41.970 --> 18:44.270
<b>Who’s that?</b>

18:44.270 --> 18:46.710
<b>That’s not really the issue here.</b>

18:46.710 --> 18:51.410
<b>The issue is that you saw what
I saw two summers ago.</b>

18:51.410 --> 18:52.950
<b>And not just me,
but a whole group of people.</b>

18:55.080 --> 18:57.920
<b>This is the first time I’ve ever
heard of something like that.</b>

18:58.650 --> 18:59.990
<b>Yeah...</b>

18:59.990 --> 19:03.460
<b>Sukawara-san wrote a book
about it, but...</b>

19:03.460 --> 19:05.890
<b>...the media didn’t take it too seriously...</b>

19:06.630 --> 19:10.600
<b>...because the only people who would have
believed it were the eyewitnesses.</b>

19:10.600 --> 19:12.830
<b>And since you were
an eyewitness back then...</b>

19:12.830 --> 19:17.640
<b>...you want society to become aware of
these “material fairies” or whatever?</b>

19:17.640 --> 19:19.070
<b>Is that it?</b>

19:20.680 --> 19:21.780
<b>No.</b>

19:21.780 --> 19:23.310
<b>Then, what?</b>

19:24.410 --> 19:26.780
<b>I don’t know how to say this...</b>

19:26.780 --> 19:30.380
<b>I won’t give Bun-chan to anyone.</b>

19:30.390 --> 19:32.790
<b>I don’t intend to make him part of some exhibition...</b>

19:33.420 --> 19:34.690
<b>I see.</b>

19:34.690 --> 19:36.260
<b>So his name’s Bun-chan.</b>

19:36.860 --> 19:42.800
<b>Believe me. I have no intention of taking him
from you or bringing this to the media.</b>

19:42.800 --> 19:44.730
<b>Even if you say that...</b>

19:45.200 --> 19:48.340
<b>If I show you mine,
will you believe me?</b>

19:48.340 --> 19:49.700
<b>Yours?</b>

19:53.210 --> 19:55.140
<b>I also have two.</b>

19:59.880 --> 20:01.580
<b>They’re named Dosshiru and Shisshin.</b>

20:01.580 --> 20:03.450
<b>You can see them, right?</b>

20:03.450 --> 20:05.020
<b>Yeah...</b>

20:05.020 --> 20:05.590
<b>I can...</b>

20:08.020 --> 20:09.990
<b>It’s a long story, but...</b>

20:09.990 --> 20:13.730
<b>The summer before last was
something special to me...</b>

20:13.730 --> 20:16.530
<b>...and I had thought that it was all over.</b>

20:18.430 --> 20:19.730
<b>I told you earlier, right?</b>

20:19.740 --> 20:22.500
<b>I feel like there’s something
left for me to do.</b>

20:22.500 --> 20:23.500
<b>Yeah.</b>

20:23.510 --> 20:27.310
<b>Honestly, I’m not too sure what that something is.</b>

20:27.310 --> 20:31.480
<b>But I feel that meeting you earlier
today wasn’t a coincidence.</b>

20:33.880 --> 20:34.950
<b>I don’t understand...</b>

20:35.720 --> 20:36.420
<b>What?</b>

20:37.320 --> 20:40.390
<b>You say you feel that there’s something
left for you to do...</b>

20:40.390 --> 20:43.390
<b>I wonder if there’s something for me to do, too?</b>

20:43.930 --> 20:46.960
<b>Yeah... that’s what I wanted to discuss with you.</b>

20:46.960 --> 20:49.160
<b>Where do we go
and what do we do now?</b>

20:52.770 --> 20:53.700
<b>Okay...</b>

21:10.620 --> 21:11.490
<b>Bun-chan!</b>

21:23.770 --> 21:24.930
<b>Aizawa-kun?!</b>

21:24.930 --> 21:26.770
<b>Sukawara-san?!</b>

21:27.870 --> 21:28.740
<b>What’s going on?</b>

21:28.740 --> 21:31.200
<b>H-Hey! Call them back!</b>

22:19.090 --> 22:23.320
<b>Noooo!</b>

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
Daremo shiranai kotoba de kimi he to

22:52.250 --> 22:59.820
On that nostalgic hill, I sang out to you

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
Utaikaketa natsukashii oka de

22:59.820 --> 23:06.530
words that no one else knew.

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
Tomare soyokaze kawaranu omoide

23:09.530 --> 23:17.030
The dying breeze and my unchanged memories

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
Sotto misete ano koro no boku wa

23:17.030 --> 23:23.710
gently reveal to me what I was like back then.

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Aa yume wo aishite hitori ni natta

23:23.710 --> 23:31.150
Ah, I thought that being alone

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
Sore de ii to omotta

23:31.150 --> 23:35.950
and cherishing my dream would be fine.

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
Haruka na sora ni wa ima mo kimi ga iru darou

23:35.950 --> 23:44.630
I wonder if you’re still there right now in the distant sky?

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Yasashiku ikiru yo afureru namida koraeta

23:44.630 --> 23:53.230
Now I lead a simple life, having suppressed my overflowing tears.

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
Mirai no melody ga shizuka ni yureru kisetsu

23:53.230 --> 24:02.010
The melody of the future is in the quietly stirring seasons.

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
Aitai na itsu no hi ka... mattete

24:02.010 --> 24:10.720
I want to see you again, and I’m waiting for that day.

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
Aitai ne boku wa mada humming boy

24:10.720 --> 24:19.260
I want to see you again, but I’m still a humming boy.

24:19.980 --> 24:22.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

24:19.980 --> 24:22.170
<b>Ah, even though I’m talking about
myself, this is magnificent.</b>

24:22.170 --> 24:25.210
<b>These flowing,
nostalgic strokes of color.</b>

24:25.210 --> 24:25.980
<b>What, what?</b>

24:25.980 --> 24:27.080
<b>Oh, you painted something!</b>

24:27.080 --> 24:29.020
<b>It’s a pretty big squid, isn’t it?</b>

24:29.020 --> 24:30.850
<b>It’s not a squid!
It’s an octopus!</b>

24:30.850 --> 24:31.990
<b>An octopus in the sky!</b>

24:31.990 --> 24:33.820
<b>Do you two have a problem
with your eyes?</b>

24:33.820 --> 24:35.660
<b>Just how is this a squid or an octopus?</b>

24:35.660 --> 24:36.590
<b>It’s neither?</b>

24:36.590 --> 24:39.590
<b>I guess you just don’t understand art.</b>

24:39.590 --> 24:41.230
<b>This is a self-portrait of myself!</b>

24:41.230 --> 24:42.200
<b>It’s my face!</b>

24:42.200 --> 24:43.660
<b>This is your face, Rokkun?</b>

24:43.660 --> 24:45.000
<b>That’s right. It’s wonderful art, isn’t it?</b>

24:45.000 --> 24:46.930
<b>Now that you mention it,
I do sorta see it as you.</b>

24:46.940 --> 24:49.040
<b>Yeah! You’re wriggly like a squid...</b>

24:49.040 --> 24:50.870
<b>...and swirling around like an octopus.</b>

24:50.870 --> 24:53.170
<b>Next time: “The Fish That Grew Wings.”</b>

24:53.180 --> 24:55.510
<b>What’s wrong, Roku?
Why are you crouching down rover there?</b>

24:55.010 --> 24:59.950
<b>The Fish That Grew Wings</b>

24:55.510 --> 24:58.180
<b>I guess I have no talent as an artist...</b>
